#. column 2: bundles of timeless Turali cloth
#. column 8: Though the base materials differ from that of modern Turali textiles, this lightweight, handwoven fabric was─and still is─considered ideal for clothing and accessories.
msgctxt "Item:44132:0:9"
msgid "Timeless Turali Cloth"
msgstr "Вечная туранская ткань"

