#. column 8: When applied to items such as battle gear, this Turali gemsap will, similarly to Eorzean dissolvents, dissolve away minute amounts of aether aspected to elements detrimental to mind, and by doing so, better attune the item and its wearer to the remaining beneficial elements.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Gemsap of Mind
msgctxt "Item:44156:0:2"
msgid "bottles of grade 2 gemsap of mind"
msgstr "бутылочки самоцветного раствора духа II"

#. ja: 装備品の仕上げに用いることで、理性を高める効果のある宝水
#. de: Diese Tinktur aus Tural wird ähnlich wie alchemistische Lösungsmittel aus Eorzea bei der Herstellung von Gegenständen zur Verbesserung der Willenskraft-Eigenschaft verwendet.
#. fr: Appliquée lors de la finition d'une pièce d'équipement, cette eau prodigieuse permet d'augmenter l'esprit.
#. column 0: bottle of grade 2 gemsap of mind
#. column 2: bottles of grade 2 gemsap of mind
#. column 9: Grade 2 Gemsap of Mind
msgctxt "Item:44156:0:8"
msgid "When applied to items such as battle gear, this Turali gemsap will, similarly to Eorzean dissolvents, dissolve away minute amounts of aether aspected to elements detrimental to mind, and by doing so, better attune the item and its wearer to the remaining beneficial elements."
msgstr "Этот туляльский самоцветный раствор, как и эорзейские растворители, при обработке экипировки растворяет небольшое количество эфира, связанного с элементами, ослабляющими дух. Благодаря этому экипировка и её владелец лучше настраиваются на оставшиеся, полезные элементы."

#. ja: 心力の宝水G2
#. de: Juwelenlösung der Willenskraft II
#. fr: Eau prodigieuse d'esprit II
#. column 0: bottle of grade 2 gemsap of mind
#. column 2: bottles of grade 2 gemsap of mind
#. column 8: When applied to items such as battle gear, this Turali gemsap will, similarly to Eorzean dissolvents, dissolve away minute amounts of aether aspected to elements detrimental to mind, and by doing so, better attune the item and its wearer to the remaining beneficial elements.
msgctxt "Item:44156:0:9"
msgid "Grade 2 Gemsap of Mind"
msgstr "Самоцветный раствор духа II"

