#. de: Säckchen[p] wilder Kaffeebohnen
#. fr: sachets de grains de café sauvages
#. column 0: sack of wild coffee beans
#. column 8: Slowly and carefully grown at mountainous altitudes, these fresh coffee beans are known to produce more complex flavors than most.
#. column 9: Wild Coffee Beans
msgctxt "Item:44172:0:2"
msgid "sacks of wild coffee beans"
msgstr "мешки дикорастущих кофейных зёрен"

#. ja: 高地の過酷な環境で育った、香味のあるコーヒーの生豆
#. de: Diese exquisiten Bohnen bergen den Geschmack von wolkigen Höhen und verschneiten Bergen, der unter Kaffeeliebhabern geschätzt wird wie kein anderer.
#. fr: Des grains de café au goût prononcé, issus de plantes ayant poussé sous le rude climat des montagnes.
#. column 0: sack of wild coffee beans
#. column 2: sacks of wild coffee beans
#. column 9: Wild Coffee Beans
msgctxt "Item:44172:0:8"
msgid "Slowly and carefully grown at mountainous altitudes, these fresh coffee beans are known to produce more complex flavors than most."
msgstr "Эти свежие кофейные зёрна медленно и бережно выращивают высоко в горах. Их вкус сложнее, чем у большинства других сортов."

