msgctxt "Item:44184:0:8"
msgid "This dish is made by giving the lobster a nice, long, scalding bath and then garnishing it with lemon and salt. A simple process that brings out the flavor of the main ingredient.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3% <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>(Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)"
msgstr "Лобстера долго варят в кипятке, а затем приправляют солью и лимоном. Простое блюдо, которое позволяет раскрыться вкусу главного ингредиента.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Бонус к опыту:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3% <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30 мин.<br>(Эффект можно продлить до 60 мин., съев несколько порций)"

#. ja: ボイルドロブスター
#. de: Gekochter Hummer
#. fr: Homard bouilli
#. column 0: serving of boiled lobster
#. column 2: servings of boiled lobster
#. column 8: This dish is made by giving the lobster a nice, long, scalding bath and then garnishing it with lemon and salt. A simple process that brings out the flavor of the main ingredient.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3% <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>(Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
msgctxt "Item:44184:0:9"
msgid "Boiled Lobster"
msgstr "Варёный лобстер"

