#. ja: パイル・オブ・ゴールド
#. de: Haufen[p] goldener Schätze
#. fr: monticule d'or
#. column 2: piles of gold
#. column 8: Nothing screams affluence (and the fragility of one's ego) like an overflowing mountain of silver and gold. Whether it truly is as valuable as it looks will always depend on the market.
#. column 9: Pile of Gold
msgctxt "Item:44269:0:0"
msgid "pile of gold"
msgstr "куча золота"

#. de: Haufen[p] goldener Schätze
#. fr: monticules d'or
#. column 0: pile of gold
#. column 8: Nothing screams affluence (and the fragility of one's ego) like an overflowing mountain of silver and gold. Whether it truly is as valuable as it looks will always depend on the market.
#. column 9: Pile of Gold
msgctxt "Item:44269:0:2"
msgid "piles of gold"
msgstr "кучи золота"

#. ja: 金貨や金塊が湧き出たように溢れた、山盛りのお宝。見かけどおりの資産価値があるかどうかは、時価による
#. de: Ein regelrechter Berg aus goldenen Schätzen, Münzen und Kleinodien, der dazu einlädt, sich in dem ganzen Reichtum zu baden. Wie reich man dadurch allerdings tatsächlich ist, definiert immer noch Angebot und Nachfrage.
#. fr: Un grand amas de pièces et de lingots d'or semblant couler à flots, qui donne à tout lieu où il est disposé des airs de caverne aux trésors. Pour autant, sa valeur réelle reste sujette aux fluctuations du marché.
#. column 0: pile of gold
#. column 2: piles of gold
#. column 9: Pile of Gold
msgctxt "Item:44269:0:8"
msgid "Nothing screams affluence (and the fragility of one's ego) like an overflowing mountain of silver and gold. Whether it truly is as valuable as it looks will always depend on the market."
msgstr "Ничто так не кричит о богатстве — и хрупком самолюбии владельца, — как гора серебра и золота. А вот стоит ли она столько, сколько кажется, решает рынок."

