msgstr "Говорят, звонкая мелодия этого крепкого свистка призывает камуя, любимца торговки Ровены."

#. ja: カムイの魔笛【商】
#. de: Geschäftiger-Kamuy-Pfeife
#. fr: Sifflet kamuy de la prospérité
#. column 0: venturous kamuy flute
#. column 2: venturous kamuy flutes
#. column 8: The audacious song of this stout flute is said to summon a kamuy favored by the merchant Rowena.
msgctxt "Item:44958:0:9"
msgid "Venturous Kamuy Flute"
msgstr "Свисток камуя искателя наживы"

#. ja: マジックプリズム:バレルテンダーヘッド
#. de: Holo-Prisma[p] „Kugelkaktor-Kugel“
#. fr: prisme magique<nbsp>: tête de maousse-pampa
#. column 2: magicked prisms (barreltender)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Envelops the user's head with the visage of an exceptionally brawny sabotender.
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Barreltender)
